Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["DiscoveryReport", "ObjectName",
 CellID->317032944,ExpressionUUID->"b260f837-ada1-054c-8e67-2788b2241aaf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"2735a147-19fb-1b43-beab-352709e72ecb"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["DiscoveryReport",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/DiscoveryReport"], 
   
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"result", ",", " ", "candidateID"}], "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"b981516d-053b-8046-84ad-88611f16e336"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the discovery-report template of the candidate with ID ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["candidateID", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cc2e2c8c-917e-5f4a-8083-c616937610f9"],
 " as an Association, with a formatted \"Text\"."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->292981395,ExpressionUUID->"1b7ec38a-696e-7743-beb7-8e799f285210"],

Cell["\<\
Fields: \"Candidate ID / evaluation ID\", \"Canonical rule\", \"Initial state\
\", \"Edge symmetry\", \"Rewrite semantics\", \"Backend and versions\", \
\"Limits and random seed\", \"Status and cycle evidence\", \"Constraint \
satisfaction\", \"State / transition / raw-event counts\", \"Lifetime \
(longest derivation and BFS depth) and maximum frontier\", \"Maximum state \
size and density\", \"Terminal-state summary\", \"Runtime\", \"Search-front / \
solution-front membership\", \"Initial-state robustness summary\", \"Mutation \
lineage\" and \"Interpretation with evidence level\". Each field carries a \
\"Summary\".\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->422665362,ExpressionUUID->"9494c375-6ffe-934f-88bc-c0e790bf28b7"],

Cell["\<\
Claims follow the project's claim discipline: \"verified to halt under this \
finite reachable exploration\" only for status \"Halted\", \"not resolved \
within the stated limits\" for every cap and time-out, \"cycle detected\" \
only with a recorded cycle witness, the state equivalence used for counts is \
always named, and no physical or all-initial-state conclusion is drawn.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->736461351,ExpressionUUID->"0e2e6165-c9f9-4f4d-bc32-002c85cf0f5a"],

Cell["\<\
The option \"Robustness\" (Automatic) controls the robustness evaluation \
behind the robustness field.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->814949146,ExpressionUUID->"4fec0e91-2fcc-dd4d-8e5f-c996c8c919be"]
}, Open  ]],

